  "label": "ironic emotional expression",
  "description": "The emotion expressed is irony, conveyed through the stark contrast between the violent scene of a gangster being shot and the unimpressed, serious expression of the man in the fedora below. The text 'gangster gettig shot' (a misspelling of 'getting shot') reinforces this ironic tone by suggesting a casual or humorous take on the violent event. The juxtaposition of dramatic violence with a mundane reaction creates a comedic effect, which is the core emotional expression of the meme.",
